---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-comment-composer</code> is the box where people write a comment: at
  the bottom of a ticket, under a document, in a reply. It starts as a one-line
  box and opens to an editor with formatting tools when focused. Comments are
  Markdown: bold, italic, strikethrough, code, links, lists, checklists, quotes
  and code blocks, plus mentions.
</p>
<p>
  <strong>Send</strong> or <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>/<kbd>⌘</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> fires
  a cancelable <code>submit</code> with
  <code>{'{ value, mentions }'}</code>; unless the event is cancelled the
  composer empties. Set <code>loading</code> while the comment saves, and
  cancel <code>submit</code> to keep the text when it fails.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style="width:100%; max-width: 40rem;">
    <wc-comment-composer id="composer-usage"></wc-comment-composer>
    <p id="composer-sent" class="text-body-small" style="margin: 8px 0 0;"></p>
  </div>
  <script is:inline>
    const composer = document.getElementById('composer-usage');
    const sent = document.getElementById('composer-sent');
    composer.addEventListener('submit', event => {
      // Pretend to save for a moment.
      composer.loading = true;
      setTimeout(() => {
        composer.loading = false;
      }, 600);
      sent.textContent = `Sent: ${event.detail.value}`;
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3 class="text-title-medium">Avatar and footer controls</h3>

<p>
  The <code>avatar</code> slot shows something before the box, usually the
  current person's avatar. The <code>start</code> slot adds controls to the
  footer after the formatting tools, such as a choice between a public comment
  and an internal work note, or an attach button.
  <code>submit-label</code> renames Send.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-comment-composer
    submit-label="Post"
    placeholder="Add a comment or work note"
    expanded
    style="display:block; width:100%; max-width: 40rem;"
  >
    <wc-avatar slot="avatar" name="Shiva Varma" size="md"></wc-avatar>
    <wc-select slot="start" size="sm" value="comment" aria-label="Visibility">
      <wc-option value="comment">Comment</wc-option>
      <wc-option value="work">Work note</wc-option>
    </wc-select>
    <wc-icon-button slot="start" variant="text" shape="round" size="sm" aria-label="Attach a file">
      <wc-icon name="attach_file"></wc-icon>
    </wc-icon-button>
  </wc-comment-composer>
</DemoComponentCard>
